            <title>0.3.5</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 03:14:24 +0530</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>9</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>What's new in SwapMac 0.3.5</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Cleanup History opens again:</b> clicking it in the sidebar did nothing in recent versions. It also laid out off the screen when it had something to show. Both fixed.</li>
<li><b>No more off-screen windows:</b> the fix behind that now covers every screen, so a note or a long line can never push the sidebar out of the window again.</li>
<li><b>License keys are checked more carefully:</b> a key file copied from another Mac uses one of the key's three seats or is refused, and a key the server no longer recognises stops working right away. Nothing changes for keys bought and entered the normal way.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
